    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ita ut idem mali­ gnus spiritus vestimentorum ejus particulas et extra illum etiam incompositas, immunda colluvione cre­ brius foedaret.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quae intantum erat horrenda, fctida et noxia, ut pars vestium quam tetigisset, nullius [Forte nulli, aut nullius rei] deinceps esset usui apta, quamquam fuisset abluta.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "De qua cum inter­ rogatus fuissem, cur omnipotens Deus talem versuto serpenti potestatem in eum dedisset, ut cordis ejus immunditiam foris ostenderet, quod numquam in exteriori habitu fecisset,",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nisi interiorem omnino corrupisset, scilicet aut infidelitate et blasphemia , aut certe inani et vana gloria, respondi : Sanies quippe inlus in corde foras per vestimenta manavit.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quem quia longe positus erat, ego quidem non vidi, sed tamen, ut arbitror, haec in illo vere prævidi.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod si ita non est, numquid tamen factum putatur sine causa et propterea gestum, ut in eo munditiam cordis foeditas illa servaret,",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nec hanc callidus hostis inani gloria foedaret: sicuti Paulus ne de revelationis magnitudine timeret, stimulum carnis accepit.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si itaque horum quodlibet, aut certe si non fuerit, numquid tamen quod ad extremum posilurus sum verum non erit? Verum est omnino.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Verum est quod dico, non esse colluvionem illam extrinsecus animae noxiam, si ipsa servare studuerit intus cordis munditiam.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Interea sicut tu ipse judicare curasti, audio quosdam apud vos dicere :",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non posse aliquem in patria suæ nativitatis perfectum esse, illud in ar­ gumentum assumentes, quod Dominus dixit : Nemo propheta acceptus est in patria sua (Luc.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "IV). Quos primum oportet ratione veritatis refelli, et sic demum qualiter intelligenda sit prolata sententia demon­ strari.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Audiant igitur patienter qui hæc dicunt, quia dum sensum sacrae Scripturae prudenter non consi­ derant, pene omnes sanctos contemnant.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si enim ita est, ut asserunt, ergo quotquot ex Romanis conversi, apud Romanos degunt : quotquot ex Graecis, apud Graecos :",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quotquot ex Italis, apud Italos : quotquot ex Hiberis, apud Hiberos : quotquot ex Germanicis, • apud Germanicos :",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quotquot ex Aquitanicis, aptid Aquitanicos : quotquot ex Anglis, apud Anglos reli­ giose vivunt, imperfecti erunt.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce Paulus et Anto­ nius ex Thebaeis, apud Thebaeos perfecti sunt. Ecce Hilarion ex. Palaestinis, apud Palaestinos perfectus est.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce Macharius ex Ægyptiis, apud Ægyptios perfectus est. Ecce Oxyrynchus civitas ex propriis civibus tota perfecta est.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce, ut ad proximos et vicinos nostros veniamus, Prothasius et Gervasius in propria hac Mediolanensi civitate,",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "propriaque domo manentes, ac per decem annos monachorum vitam exercentes, ita perfecti fuerunt, ut martyres fierent.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s22",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "An fone sola nostra provincia extra hanc re­ gulam erit excepta, ut non de propriis, sed tantum de extremis [Forte externis] habeat monachos.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s23",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s23",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Satagendum igitur magis est, ut ubi quis fuerit, juxta regulam perfectorum vivat, et non parentum, non propinquorum, non affinium illecebris a via perfec­ tionis declinet (Matth. XIX).",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s24",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s24",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Siccerte, juxtaSalvatoris sententiam, patri, matrique, fratribus, sororibusque, uxoribus, filiis, domibus, agris, et cunctis quae poss!­ det renuntiare valebit.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s25",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s25",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hoc autem dico non quo se­ cessores qui de regno ad regnum, de publico ad eremum transeunt, summa laude non ducam :",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s26",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s26",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed quoetiam illos qui magis effectibus [Forte, affectibus] patriam fugiunt, quam gressibus, felices atque per­ fectos ostendam.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s27",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s27",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Obsecro itaque illos qui hæc apud vos fieri posse denegant, ut vigilanti studio conside­ rent, cur non dixerit Dominus :",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s28",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s28",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nemo propheta per­ fectus est in patria sua, sed : Nemo acceptus est in patria sua (Luc. tv).",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep#PL17.EP.2.s29",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_36_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s29",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed ibi quid aliud intelligendum est, nisi quia non acceptum dixit, nequaquam recep­ tum.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
